  "Title": "Implementation of health and health related SDGs: Current status and opportunities in Pakistan",
  "NewsSubTitle": "Sustainable Development Goals",
  "NewsSummary": "This meeting was held on the subject of \"Implementation of health and health related SDGs: Current status and opportunities in Pakistan\" on January 6, 2020 at Islamabad. This was a planned collaborative activity amongst the Federal Ministry of Nation",
